Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 15:09:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] fix(p01): tool calls survive gpt-oss harmony markers; no
 Conway key is not a dead agent

Observed on the deployed colony: every tool call failed with 'Unknown tool:
check_credits<|channel|>commentary'. gpt-oss models leak harmony control markers
into the function name and arguments, so the agent could not use a single tool.

- sanitizeToolName / sanitizeToolArguments / stripHarmonyMarkers on every
  OpenAI-compatible and Anthropic completion; arguments always parse
- getCreditsBalance returns 0 without calling the API when there is no key,
  instead of a 401 per turn that the loop read as an unreachable balance API
- with a free inference pool, an empty wallet no longer forces low-compute or
  dead: thinking is free, so only uselessness kills a lineage

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
